2.2. Weyssenhoff fluid description in a 1+3 covariant formalism
The 1+3 covariant formalism outlined in the appendix can now be used to perform a more
transparent analysis of the Weyssenhoff fluid dynamics. Using a 1+3 covariant approach in
[10], we found that the symmetric stress–energy–momentum tensor (8) can be recast as
                  s
